Project Scope

System
Software Bug Reporting and Tracking System for a University Student Portal.

User Groups
1. End User (Student)
2. Developer
3. Administrator

System Features
1. User registration and login
2. Bug report submission
3. View and track bug reports
4. Edit and delete bug reports
5. Bug assignment to develoers
6. Update buy status
7. User account management
8. Bug report monitoring
